Adds the XML_STRING function from [FLIP-612|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/FLINK/pages/451974259/FLIP-612+Native+XML+Functions+for+Flink+SQL].

It converts a VARIANT produced by PARSE_XML back into an XML string, so that parsing the result again returns the same VARIANT. See the FLIP for the details.

This also adds Table API and PyFlink support.


{code:java}
XML_STRING(variant) → STRING{code}

